msgid ""
"Services like ``phpbb\\mimetype\\guesser`` and ``phpbb\\plupload\\plupload``"
" are no longer passed to the upload methods."
msgstr ""
"Services som ``phpbb\\mimetype\\guesser`` og ``phpbb\\plupload\\plupload`` "
"sendes ikke længere til upload-metoderne."

