#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/files/upload.rst:111
msgid ""
"Since the ``upload`` class is retrieved with the container or the factory, "
"passing these settings to the constructor is no longer possible. Instead, "
"these should be passed with the accompanying ``set_`` methods:"
msgstr ""
"Da ``upload``-klassen hentes med containeren eller factory'en, er det ikke "
"længere muligt at sende disse indstillinger til konstruktøren. I stedet bør "
"disse sendes med de tilhørende ``set_``-metoder:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/files/upload.rst:123
msgid ""
"This can also be chained to directly call the ``handle_upload()`` method:"
msgstr ""
"Dette kan også kædes for direkte at kalde metoden ``handle_upload()``:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/files/upload.rst:136
msgid "Reset settings"
msgstr "Nulstil indstillinger"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/files/upload.rst:138
msgid ""
"The settings like maximum file size, allowed dimensions, and error prefix "
"can easily be reset using the ``reset_vars()`` method."
msgstr ""
"Indstillinger som maksimal filstørrelse, tilladte dimensioner og fejlpræfiks"
" kan nemt nulstilles ved hjælp af metoden ``reset_vars()``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/files/upload.rst:142
msgid "Perform common checks on upload"
msgstr "Udfør almindelige kontroller på upload"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/files/upload.rst:144
msgid ""
"The ``common_checks()`` method can be used to perform common checks on the "
"``filespec`` object returned by the ``handle_upload()`` method. These "
"include checks for the file size of the uploaded file, the file's name and "
"extension, and disallowed file content. This can be performed by simply "
"passing the ``filespec`` object:"
msgstr ""
"Metoden ``common_checks()`` kan bruges til at udføre almindelige kontroller "
"på ``filespec``-objektet, der returneres af metoden ``handle_upload()``. "
"Disse omfatter kontrol af filstørrelsen på den uploadede fil, filens navn og"
" filtypenavn samt ikke-tilladt filindhold. Dette kan udføres ved blot at "
"sende ``filespec``-objektet:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/files/upload.rst:155
msgid ""
"``common_checks()`` does not have a function return. Instead, please check "
"the ``$filespec->error`` property after running ``common_checks()``"
msgstr ""
"``common_checks()`` har ikke en returværdi. Kontrollér i stedet egenskaben "
"``$filespec->error`` efter kørsel af ``common_checks()``"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/files/upload.rst:159
msgid "Check form for validity"
msgstr "Kontrollér formular for gyldighed"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/files/upload.rst:161
msgid ""
"One can check if a form is valid for file uploads by simply passing the form"
" name to the ``is_valid()`` method. It will return true on valid forms and "
"false if the file was not uploaded for the specified form or the upload file"
" was not properly set."
msgstr ""
"Man kan kontrollere, om en formular er gyldig til filuploads, ved blot at "
"sende formularnavnet til metoden ``is_valid()``. Den returnerer true for "
"gyldige formularer og false, hvis filen ikke blev uploadet for den angivne "
"formular, eller hvis uploadfilen ikke blev korrekt angivet."
